sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Parceiro BaaS
    participant W as API OpenPix
    participant N as Provedor de nota fiscal

    P->>W: POST /api/v1/invoice/integration
    W->>N: Cadastra a empresa da conta
    W-->>P: 201 integration.status = CONFIGURING

    P->>W: POST /api/v1/invoice/integration/certificate
    W->>N: Envia o certificado A1
    W-->>P: 200 integration.status

    P->>W: POST /api/v1/invoice/integration/test
    W->>N: Emite a nota fiscal de teste
    W-->>P: 200 invoice.id + integration.id
    N-->>W: Webhook confirmando a nota de teste
    W->>W: integration.status = CONFIGURED e isActive = true

    P->>W: GET /api/v1/invoice/integration
    W-->>P: 200 integration.status = CONFIGURED
